window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A wish whisks me away to Faerie, where I have magic! And a \"married at first sight\" orc </b><b><i>husband.</i></b></p> <p>Stuck slinging pizzas in the deadest of dead-end jobs, I make a wish. In a blink, I'm teetering on top of a standing stone in Faerie, where I have magical powers!</p> <p>And monsters fighting over me!</p> <p>Thank god, the orc wins. A fierce and deadly warrior, Rovann's nothing but gentle with me.</p> <p>I'm stunned when he claims me as his moon bound bride, saying we're already magically matched and married. I never imagined being wed to a stranger, even one who makes my heart flutter. When I tell him humans don’t work like that, Rovann vows to woo me.</p> <p>No matter what it takes.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
